>> Product := Wanta haaraa.
Product irratti: ['a'] godhi: { :price
	Baʼii barreessi: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product haaraa.
Baʼii barreessi: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Baʼii barreessi: [' cent a piece.'].
Lakkoofsa irratti: ['X'] godhi: { :b
	b × ofii.
}.
7 X { :i Baʼii barreessi: i. }.
